{"schemaVersion":1,"unitId":"u003","words":[{"word":"student","phonetic":"/ˈstjuːdənt/","meanings":[{"meaning":"学生","pos":"noun","usage":"指正在学习的人，可指任何年龄段的学习者"}]},{"word":"French","phonetic":"/frentʃ/","meanings":[{"meaning":"adj/noun. 法国的","usage":"作形容词表示国籍，作名词指法国人或法语"},{"meaning":"法国人"}]},{"word":"German","phonetic":"/ˈdʒɜːmən/","meanings":[{"meaning":"adj/noun. 德国的","usage":"作形容词表示国籍，作名词指德国人或德语"},{"meaning":"德国人"}]},{"word":"Japanese","phonetic":"/ˌdʒæpəˈniːz/","meanings":[{"meaning":"adj/noun. 日本的","usage":"单复数同形Japanese，指一个人时用a Japanese"},{"meaning":"日本人"}]},{"word":"Korean","phonetic":"/kəˈriən/","meanings":[{"meaning":"adj/noun. 韩国的","usage":"作形容词表示国籍，作名词指韩国人或韩语"},{"meaning":"韩国人"}]},{"word":"Chinese","phonetic":"/ˌtʃaɪˈniːz/","meanings":[{"meaning":"adj/noun. 中国的","usage":"单复数同形Chinese，指一个人时用a Chinese"},{"meaning":"中国人"}]},{"word":"nice","phonetic":"/naɪs/","meanings":[{"meaning":"令人愉快的","pos":"adj","usage":"形容人、事物或体验令人愉悦"},{"meaning":"友好的"}]},{"word":"meet","phonetic":"/miːt/","meanings":[{"meaning":"遇见","pos":"verb","usage":"指第一次见面或认识某人"},{"meaning":"结识"}]},{"word":"morning","phonetic":"/ˈmɔːnɪŋ/","meanings":[{"meaning":"早晨","pos":"noun","usage":"通常指从午夜到中午的时间段"},{"meaning":"上午"}]},{"word":"Miss","phonetic":"/mɪs/","meanings":[{"meaning":"小姐","pos":"noun","usage":"对未婚女性的称呼，用于姓或姓名之前"},{"meaning":"女士"}]},{"word":"Mr.","phonetic":"/ˈmɪstə/","meanings":[{"meaning":"abbr. 先生","usage":"Mister的缩写，用于姓之前"}]},{"word":"too","phonetic":"/tuː/","meanings":[{"meaning":"也","pos":"adv","usage":"用于肯定句句末，表示“同样”之意"},{"meaning":"同样"}]}],"phrases":[{"phrase":"Good morning","usage":"早晨问候语，用于上午见面时","examples":[{"en":"Good morning, Mr. Blake.","zh":"早上好，布莱克先生。"}]},{"phrase":"Nice to meet you","usage":"用于第一次见面时表示很高兴认识对方","examples":[{"en":"Nice to meet you.","zh":"很高兴认识你。"}]},{"phrase":"This is...","usage":"介绍他人时的常用句型","examples":[{"en":"This is Miss Sophie Dupont.","zh":"这是苏菲·杜邦小姐。"}]},{"phrase":"He is / She is","usage":"用于描述他人的性别和国籍","examples":[{"en":"She is French.","zh":"她是法国人。